- Verification passed: `cargo test --locked -p rocketmq-classic-integration` (2 tests), strict integration-bin Clippy, integration-bin build, `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, Maven `verify`, Maven compile after final CLI usage text, shell syntax, Python compilation, comparator self-test, 37-row manifest validation, and `git diff --check`.
